    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "label": "sdc02_0130_reception_12",
      "hash64": "4DCCCA47738F8A4A",
      "text": "그럼, 블루베리그에서의\\n건투를 빌겠습니다!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "label": "sdc02_0130_dragonbb_11",
      "hash64": "556BA294434EA937",
      "text": "어디부터 도전할지는\\n너에게 맡길게.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
